    "text": "This is a greedy scheduler that only uses `impl` tasks. It never moves services and never creates binaries, so the output stays valid regardless of timing details. It has not been compiled or run against the real data sets, so I don't have scores for it.\n\n**Approach**\n- **Task list:** each feature is turned into one `impl` task for every distinct binary that holds at least one of its services. A feature's tasks are ordered with the largest binary first.\n- **Day-by-day simulation:** engineers become free in order of day, then engineer index. That is the same order the file lists them, so same-day starts on one binary see the correct C_B (engineers already working there).\n- **Assigning work:** each free engineer takes the next task of the current feature. If that feature has no tasks left, the engineer starts the next feature in priority order.\n- **Skipping late features:** a new feature is skipped if even its longest task can't finish before L.\n- **Dropping failing features:** if a feature's next task would end at or after L, the feature is dropped and no more engineers are put on it.\n- **Picking the order:** features are sorted by U / work^a, where work = sum of (D + R_B) over the feature's binaries. The program simulates 9 values of a and outputs the schedule with the best computed score.\n\n**Why the output is always valid**\n- Each (feature, binary) pair is assigned to exactly one engineer, once.\n- Every task starts before L and takes at least 2 days, so each engineer has at most L tasks.\n- Engineers with no tasks are left out of the file, which keeps the remaining engineers in their original relative order.\n\n**Assumption:** an engineer whose task ends on day t no longer counts toward C_B on day t. If the official checker counts differently, only the timings and my score estimate shift; validity is unaffected because no moves are used.\n\n```cpp\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nstatic char buf[1<<25];\nint bufLen=0,bufPos=0;\ninline int gc(){ if(bufPos==bufLen){ bufLen=fread(buf,1,sizeof(buf),stdin); bufPos=0; if(bufLen<=0) return -1;} return buf[bufPos++]; }\ninline string readTok(){ int c=gc(); while(c==' '||c=='\\n'||c=='\\r') c=gc(); string s; while(c!=-1&&c!=' '&&c!='\\n'&&c!='\\r'){ s.push_back((char)c); c=gc(); } return s; }\ninline long long readInt(){ int c=gc(); while(c==' '||c=='\\n'||c=='\\r') c=gc(); long long x=0; bool neg=false; if(c=='-'){neg=true;c=gc();} while(c>='0'&&c<='9'){ x=x*10+(c-'0'); c=gc(); } return neg?-x:x; }\n\nint L,G,S,B,F,N;\nvector<string> fname;\nvector<int> FD; vector<long long> FU;\nvector<vector<int>> fbins; // sorted by R desc\nvector<int> R;\nvector<double> fwork;\n\nvector<vector<pair<int,int>>> outTasks;\n\nlong long simulate(const vector<int>& order, bool record){\n    if(record){ outTasks.assign(G,{}); }\n    vector<priority_queue<int,vector<int>,greater<int>>> act(B);\n    priority_queue<pair<int,int>,vector<pair<int,int>>,greater<pair<int,int>>> pq;\n    for(int i=0;i<G;i++) pq.push({0,i});\n    long long score=0;\n    size_t oi=0; int cur=-1; size_t ti=0; int curEnd=0; bool curFailed=false;\n    auto Cof=[&](int b,int t){ auto &h=act[b]; while(!h.empty()&&h.top()<=t) h.pop(); return (int)h.size(); };\n    auto finalize=[&](){\n        if(cur>=0 && !curFailed && ti>=fbins[cur].size() && curEnd<L) score+=FU[cur]*(long long)(L-curEnd);\n        cur=-1;\n    };\n    bool exhausted=false;\n    while(!pq.empty()){\n        auto [t,e]=pq.top(); pq.pop();\n        if(t>=L||exhausted) continue;\n        bool assigned=false;\n        while(true){\n            if(cur>=0 && !curFailed && ti<fbins[cur].size()){\n                int b=fbins[cur][ti];\n                int dur=FD[cur]+R[b]+Cof(b,t);\n                int end=t+dur;\n                if(end>=L){ curFailed=true; continue; }\n                ti++;\n                curEnd=max(curEnd,end);\n                act[b].push(end);\n                if(record) outTasks[e].push_back({cur,b});\n                pq.push({end,e});\n                assigned=true;\n                break;\n            }\n            finalize();\n            // find next feasible feature\n            bool found=false;\n            while(oi<order.size()){\n                int f=order[oi++];\n                int b=fbins[f][0];\n                int est=t+FD[f]+R[b]+Cof(b,t);\n                if(est<L){ cur=f; ti=0; curEnd=0; curFailed=false; found=true; break; }\n            }\n            if(!found){ exhausted=true; break; }\n        }\n        (void)assigned;\n    }\n    finalize();\n    return score;\n}\n\nint main(){\n    L=readInt(); G=readInt(); S=readInt(); B=readInt(); F=readInt(); N=readInt();\n    unordered_map<string,int> sid; sid.reserve(S*2+10);\n    vector<int> sbin(S);\n    R.assign(B,0);\n    for(int i=0;i<S;i++){ string s=readTok(); int b=readInt(); sid[s]=i; sbin[i]=b; R[b]++; }\n    fname.resize(F); FD.resize(F); FU.resize(F); fbins.resize(F); fwork.resize(F);\n    vector<int> mark(B,-1);\n    for(int i=0;i<F;i++){\n        fname[i]=readTok(); int m=readInt(); FD[i]=readInt(); FU[i]=readInt();\n        for(int j=0;j<m;j++){ string s=readTok(); int b=sbin[sid[s]]; if(mark[b]!=i){ mark[b]=i; fbins[i].push_back(b);} }\n        sort(fbins[i].begin(),fbins[i].end(),[&](int a,int b){ return R[a]>R[b]; });\n        double w=0; for(int b:fbins[i]) w+=FD[i]+R[b];\n        fwork[i]=w;\n    }\n    vector<double> exps={0.5,0.75,1.0,1.25,1.5,2.0,3.0,0.0,1.0};\n    long long best=-1; vector<int> bestOrder;\n    for(size_t k=0;k<exps.size();k++){\n        double a=exps[k];\n        vector<double> key(F);\n        for(int i=0;i<F;i++){\n            if(k==8){ // by max duration\n                double md=FD[i]+R[fbins[i][0]];\n                key[i]=(double)FU[i]/ (md*sqrt(fwork[i]));\n            } else key[i]=(double)FU[i]/pow(fwork[i],a);\n        }\n        vector<int> order(F); iota(order.begin(),order.end(),0);\n        stable_sort(order.begin(),order.end(),[&](int x,int y){ return key[x]>key[y]; });\n        long long sc=simulate(order,false);\n        if(sc>best){ best=sc; bestOrder=order; }\n    }\n    simulate(bestOrder,true);\n    string out;\n    int E=0; for(int i=0;i<G;i++) if(!outTasks[i].empty()) E++;\n    out+=to_string(E)+\"\\n\";\n    for(int i=0;i<G;i++){\n        if(outTasks[i].empty()) continue;\n        out+=to_string(outTasks[i].size())+\"\\n\";\n        for(auto &p:outTasks[i]){\n            out+=\"impl \"; out+=fname[p.first]; out+=' '; out+=to_string(p.second); out+='\\n';\n        }\n    }\n    fwrite(out.data(),1,out.size(),stdout);\n    return 0;\n}\n```",
